  "body": "Want to be close to Wentworth schools, and the Gulf Harbour marina? 18 Bella Vista Drive delivers a home and lifestyle that's effortlessly easy to love. Set within sought-after Bella Vista Estate, this meticulously crafted brick and weatherboard home offers generous living, the flexibility of a ground-floor, or upstairs master suite, and a fabulous north-facing deck framed by a private, leafy outlook. Imagine sunny mornings in the kitchen, kids having their own space upstairs, and entertaining that naturally flows outdoors - all while having the best of the Gulf Harbour lifestyle right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 513sqm freehold, beautifully landscaped section\r\n* Quality brick and weatherboard construction\r\n* Double glazing for year-round comfort\r\n* Option of a ground-floor master if you want easy single-level living\r\n* Three further generous bedrooms upstairs\r\n* Large upstairs bedroom with walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Cleverly positioned study nook\r\n* Designer kitchen with spacious butler's pantry\r\n* Pantry includes additional sink, dishwasher and loads of storage\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to north-facing deck\r\n* Private, leafy outlook with plenty of sunshine\r\n\r\nWentworth College and Wentworth Primary are both within easy reach, making the school run simple, while Marine Village provides shops, restaurants and everyday essentials close to home. Gulf Harbour Marina and the boat ramp put the Hauraki Gulf within easy reach, with Shakespear Regional Park and beautiful local beaches providing plenty of options for weekends outdoors. And with ferry connections to Auckland CBD, you can enjoy the relaxed Whangaparaoa Peninsula lifestyle without feeling disconnected from the city.\r\n\r\nQuality, flexibility, sunshine and an enviable location - this is a home that deserves to be seen.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XK4E\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
